## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design scalable, auditable access controls in a multi-tenant streaming system while balancing privacy requirements with analytics capabilities.

## Key Concepts
- ABAC, policy-as-code, OPA, and KCNA sandbox isolation
- Per-tenant encryption and cryptographic key management
